<% p = @data['project'] %>
<% content_for(:page_title) { "About — #{p['name']}" } %>
<div class="netd-page">
  <h1 class="h3">About the <%= p['name'] %></h1>
  <p><%= p['summary'] %></p>
  <div class="netd-partner-logos">
    <a href="<%= p['group_url'] %>" class="datalab-credit" title="DataLab Research Group" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="/images/datalab-logo-light.svg" alt="DataLab Research Group" height="40"></a>
    <a href="https://zamren.zm" class="zamren-credit" title="Zambia Research and Education Network" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="/images/zamren-logo.png" alt="ZAMREN — Zambia Research and Education Network" height="48"></a>
  </div>
  <p>Developed by the <%= link_to p['group'], p['group_url'], target: '_blank', rel: 'noopener' %>, and hosted by
    <%= link_to 'ZAMREN', 'https://zamren.zm', target: '_blank', rel: 'noopener' %> (Zambia Research and Education Network), which
    provides the server space for the portal. See also the <%= link_to 'credits', credits_path %>.
    Project page: <%= link_to p['url'], p['url'], target: '_blank', rel: 'noopener' %></p>
  <h2 class="h5 mt-4">Project members</h2>
  <ul class="netd-members">
    <% p['members'].each do |m| %><li><strong><%= m['url'] ? link_to(m['name'], m['url'], target: '_blank', rel: 'noopener') : m['name'] %></strong> (<%= m['role'] %>)</li><% end %>
  </ul>
  <h2 class="h5 mt-4">Publications based on the <%= link_to 'Zambia National ETD Portal project', p['url'], target: '_blank', rel: 'noopener' %></h2>
  <p>The publications, dissertations and capstone reports below come out of the <%= link_to 'Zambia National ETD Portal project', p['url'], target: '_blank', rel: 'noopener' %>.
    They study the visibility of Zambian research, the quality, completeness and ETD-MS compliance of ETD metadata in
    institutional repositories, and ways of improving it; their findings shaped how this portal harvests, cleans and
    presents ETD metadata.</p>
  <ul class="netd-pubs">
    <% @data['publications'].each do |x| %>
      <li><span class="etd-badge etd-badge-year"><%= x['year'] %></span> <span class="etd-badge etd-badge-level"><%= x['type'] %></span><br>
        <%= x['authors'] %> (<%= x['year'] %>). <em><%= x['title'] %></em>. <%= x['venue'] %>.
        <%= link_to x['url'], x['url'], target: '_blank', rel: 'noopener' %></li>
    <% end %>
  </ul>
  <p class="mt-3"><%= link_to '← Back to search', root_path %></p>
</div>
